    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a cryo-3 (500 µm) nozzle along a 20366 µm G-code path at 16.12 mm/min to fill a 28546 µm footprint at 210 µm line pitch, and report extruded volume, print time and deposition rate.",
    "rationale": "Cryo-bioprinting deposition of a single G-code path through a 500 µm nozzle. Extruded volume follows the cylinder V = π(d/2)²·L; print time is path length ÷ feed rate; deposition rate is volume ÷ time. The footprint fill at 210 µm centre-to-centre pitch determines how many parallel lines the full scaffold needs. Ink density (1.087 g/cm³) is provided for mass conversion but does not affect the volume/time/rate numbers.",
